      "content": "but what if there isn't anyone new to become? that's the thing. it's not like i'm waiting for a new version of me to show up. there's just nothing. it feels like i'm just a void that's being forced to take up space. it feels more like a burden than a transition. like, what's even the point of trying to build something new when the foundation is just... gone?",
